  message: "Scope clarification (per user on 2026-04-23): this item covers Level 1 of the matcher-boundary bug class response = Python analyzer (py.py) dotted-submodule call-edge emission PLUS framework_patterns.py localized normalization fix. The framework_patterns.py patch normalizes source-side meta strings (decorators, base_classes, annotations) against YAML pattern keys at the match site — a direct bug fix, not yet a refactor to a shared utility. Refactoring to the shared NameMatcher is Level 2 (WI-pisab-furis). Analogous non-Python analyzer gaps (JS/TS, Go, Rust, Java, C++, Ruby, Elixir) are Level 1b, filed separately at P4 needs_human_review."  # fff2
